      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/ed8c10618b977071d319ec53f5714413c975c285/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2026-07-04-18-00-00.gh-issue-153014.gCdBg1.rst",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/contents/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2026-07-04-18-00-00.gh-issue-153014.gCdBg1.rst?ref=ed8c10618b977071d319ec53f5714413c975c285",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@\n+Fix a data race on the garbage collector debug flag in free-threading builds:\n+:func:`gc.set_debug` and :func:`gc.get_debug` now access it atomically."
    },
    {
