      "updated_at": "2026-07-08T16:14:29Z",
      "body": "This looks worth fixing.  Some suggested improvements:\r\n- Use `threading_helper.run_concurrently()`\r\n- Remove the thread that runs GC collections.  I don't think that's useful since it stops-the-world.\r\n- I'd use one writer and one reader.  It would be enough to trigger the TSAN warnings.\r\n- If `gc->debug` is read more than once inside a function, read it into a local variable.",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
